  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. In a large bowl, whisk together zesty, olive oil, lemon juice, garlic, italian seasoning, salt, and pepper.",
    "3. Add the chicken to the marinade and mix well to coat.",
    "4. Cover the bowl with plastic wrap and refrigerate for at least 30 minutes or up to 2 hours.",
    "5. Thread the marinated chicken onto the skewers.",
    "6. Grill the skewers for 8-10 minutes, or until the chicken is cooked through.",
    "7. Brush with additional olive oil during the last minute of grilling.",
    "8. Serve hot and enjoy!"
